What we'll build after Sprint 1

Once the foundation is complete, we'll move into Sprint 2, where we'll create the production-ready authentication and organization system with:

Clerk Organizations

User onboarding

Role & permission management

Organization dashboard

Invitation system

Profile management


After that, we'll begin implementing the Property module, turning the architecture you've designed into a working application. This progression keeps each sprint focused and builds on a stable foundation rather than introducing too many moving parts at once.
